x-inc-box-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BOX 2021 Q1","e":"box","d":"2020-05-27","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Melissa Franchi","x":"When we're looking at your revenue guide for the full year '21, can you help us quantify what the impact is from some of the assumptions around a lower SMB renewal rate versus professional services headwinds, or any other factors that might be driving a lower outlook for the full year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/box-inc-box-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BOX 2021 Q2","e":"box","d":"2020-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Rishi Jaluria","x":"And maybe looking forward to post-pandemic when hopefully things are back to normal the ability to get on planes and travel is there, how long lasting do you see these cost savings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/26/box-inc-box-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BOX 2021 Q3","e":"box","d":"2020-12-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Aaron Levie","x":"And I would say that it's less about the remote work aspect of how business is getting done and much more of just the budget environment and the level of kind of steps and scrutiny that deals tend to have to pass through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/02/box-inc-box-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BOX 2021 Q3","e":"box","d":"2020-12-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dylan Smith","x":"Going forward, we will continue to improve on our strategy to deliver long-term profitable growth by executing against several initiatives to deliver efficiencies and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/02/box-inc-box-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BOX 2022 Q2","e":"box","d":"2021-08-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dylan Smith","x":"Suites have enabled us to streamline our sales process and drive greater adoption of multi-product soluti